---
description: |
  Reduces the volume of HarfangLab OCSF events for a SIEM. The operator
  summarizes Network Activity and HTTP Activity, and deduplicates process
  launches and Module Activity, with `harfanglab::ocsf::summarize_network`,
  `harfanglab::ocsf::summarize_http`,
  `harfanglab::ocsf::deduplicate_processes`, and
  `harfanglab::ocsf::deduplicate_modules`. Set `network`, `http`,
  `processes`, or `modules` to `false` to pass that class through unchanged.
  Events of all other classes, such as findings, API activity, DNS activity,
  and authentications, pass through unchanged.

  Only summaries carry `count`, the number of events they stand for, so a SIEM
  that counts events must sum `count` and count every other event as one.
  Windows follow processing time and align to the epoch: summaries leave in
  one burst at each window boundary, up to one window after their events, so
  search them by index time. Each summary covers at most one window of event
  time per host, so late events get their own summaries and none is dropped.
  Open windows live in memory and are lost on a restart; first occurrences
  have already left by then.

  Memory grows with the summaries per window: about 2 KB per network or HTTP
  summary, 3 KB per module and 5 KB per process summary, plus 0.4 KB per
  distinct process or module key. After an outage of N windows, the drained
  backlog needs about N times as much. Summaries keep at most 10 URL paths, a
  query string only if it is the same for all requests, no module base
  addresses, and no process IDs of several repeats, so detections on these
  fields need the full events, for example in a data lake.
args:
  named:
    - name: network_window
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: Width of the Network Activity summary windows.
    - name: http_window
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: Width of the HTTP Activity summary windows.
    - name: process_window
      type: duration
      default: 1h
      description: Width of the process launch deduplication windows.
    - name: module_window
      type: duration
      default: 1h
      description: Width of the Module Activity deduplication windows.
    - name: network
      type: bool
      default: true
      description: Summarize Network Activity.
    - name: http
      type: bool
      default: true
      description: Summarize HTTP Activity.
    - name: processes
      type: bool
      default: true
      description: Deduplicate process launches.
    - name: modules
      type: bool
      default: true
      description: Deduplicate Module Activity.
---

if $network and class_uid == 4001 {
  harfanglab::ocsf::summarize_network window=$network_window
} else if $http and class_uid == 4002 {
  harfanglab::ocsf::summarize_http window=$http_window
} else if $processes and class_uid == 1007 {
  harfanglab::ocsf::deduplicate_processes window=$process_window
} else if $modules and class_uid == 1005 {
  harfanglab::ocsf::deduplicate_modules window=$module_window
}
